$Descr A3 16535 11693
Sheet 1 1
Title "R3 Power Module"
Date "2026-09-28"
Rev "A"
Comp "R3 — STM32H755 + ESP32-S3 + isolated ADS131M08"
Comment1 "Nominal input: regulated 9 V / 0.5 A from DFRobot DFR0535 OUT3"
Comment2 "DGND and GND_ISO must remain galvanically isolated"
Comment3 "Prototype design — verify thermals, ripple and source headroom"
Comment4 "See R3_power_module_design.md"
$EndDescr
Text Notes 700 650 0    110  ~ 22
INPUT PROTECTION — 9 V NOMINAL ONLY
Text Notes 5000 650 0    110  ~ 22
3.3 V DIGITAL BUCK
Text Notes 5000 3900 0    110  ~ 22
5 V PRE-ISOLATION BUCK
Text Notes 9000 3900 0    110  ~ 22
GALVANIC ISOLATION
Text Notes 9000 6350 0    110  ~ 22
ISOLATED ANALOG / DIGITAL LDOs
Text Notes 12600 650 0    80   ~ 12
POWER OUTPUTS / TEST
Wire Notes Line
	8800 700 8800 10700
Wire Notes Line
	12100 700 12100 10700
Text Notes 8850 1050 1    65   ~ 12
ISOLATION BARRIER — NO COPPER / VIAS / TEST PADS

